9:## 0. Decisions (resolved 2026-09-01)
11:1. **Secrets in Rails credentials**, production-only file (`config/credentials/production.yml.enc`), keys `schwab.app_key`, `schwab.app_secret`, `mcp.bearer_token`, `anthropic.api_key`, `resend.api_key`, plus Active Record Encryption keys. `SCHWAB_CALLBACK_URL` and `MEMORY_REPO_PATH` stay in dokku ENV (not secret). The dokku `SCHWAB_APP_KEY`/`SCHWAB_APP_SECRET` vars get unset once the credentials file is on the server.
13:3. **Web login is passwordless magic link**, built on the Rails 8 auth generator with `generates_token_for :magic_link` (15 min, single use). Users are seeded, not self-registered: john@athayde.com and whitney@athayde.com only. No gem.
15:5. **`evaluate_hypothetical_order` omitted** from Phase 1. `get_risk_rules` ships and returns the (empty) `risk_rules` rows.
16:6. **§5.12 allocation tables deferred** to Phase 2.5.
21:## 1. Migrations (in creation order)
25:| # | Table | Key columns | Phase 1 populated? |
