28:| 2 | `schwab_tokens` | `access_token` (encrypted), `refresh_token` (encrypted), `access_expires_at`, `refresh_expires_at`, `issued_at`, `last_refreshed_at`, `last_refresh_error`, `scope` | yes |
29:| 3 | `accounts` | `encrypted_hash_id` (Schwab's hashValue, unique), `account_type` enum (taxable/ira), `trading_enabled` bool, `nickname`, `last_synced_at`. Plaintext number is never a column. | yes |
