33:| 7 | `orders` | `account_id`, `instrument_id`, `broker_order_id` (unique per account), `status` enum incl. Phase 2 states, `side`, `quantity`, `filled_quantity`, `order_type`, `limit_price`, `stop_price`, `duration`, `session`, `tax_lot_method`, `placed_via` enum (schwab_direct/app), `parent_order_id` (self FK), `order_proposal_id` (nullable), `entered_at`, `closed_at`, `raw` jsonb | yes (sync only) |
