docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:5:## Actors and entry points
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:9:1. **Push/email notification** → deep link to a specific proposal, trade, or health alert. This is the primary mobile entry.
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:10:2. **Direct visit** → dashboard.
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:11:3. **Sunday email** → re-auth link and edge review link.
