docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:28:## Flow 1: Morning glance (mobile, read-only)
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:32:Dashboard states (mutually exclusive banners, one at a time):
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:33:- **Healthy:** no banner.
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:34:- **Token expiring:** refresh token < 24h. Banner links to re-auth flow.
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:42:## Flow 2: Review and approve a proposal (mobile-first, the core flow)
