docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:61:## Flow 3: Manual proposal (human-initiated)
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:72:## Flow 4: Post-trade journal entry (mobile-first, 30-second task)
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:74:Fill detected → journal row auto-created from transactions (entry/exit, R-multiple computed). EOD email lists rows missing post-mortems → tap → **Trade detail**.
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:78:Rationale: if the journal entry takes more than 30 seconds on a phone, it stops happening.
docs/artifacts/investment-copilot-ui-flows.md:80:## Flow 5: Sunday ritual
